WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.220
Oh crap! I'm late!

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.550
Why didn't they wake me up?!

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.190
Because it was futile.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.240
They should still wake me even <i>if</i> it's futile!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.300
Yuma!

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.360
Oh! Tetsuo!

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.450
Later!

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.090
Wah! You jerk!

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.080
Ow, ow, ow...

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.090
Tetsuo!

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.760
Are you all right?

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.930
R-Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.440
My, it looks like you've scraped your arm.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.360
This should do it.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.690
Th-Thank you very much!

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.570
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.630
What's wrong with you, Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>?

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.600
It feels like he's here in body, but not in soul, meow.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.650
Could this be...?

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.450
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.280
It's the usual... isn't it?

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:28.550
But if you like Rio-<i>san</i> that much, you should just attack her with all your feelings!

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:29.680
Attack?

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.010
But what if I'm rejected...?

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.690
And Rio-<i>san</i>'s Shark's little sister, you know.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.240
That's right!

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:40.630
She has her fans, but they can't attack if they're all scared of Shark.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:42.200
That's true, isn't it?

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.910
That <i>isn't</i> true!

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.990
All that's important is your feelings, right?!

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.420
That's right, isn't it?!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.590
But if he doesn't approve, Shark will punch you full of holes!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.780
Really...?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:53.980
On the other hand...

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:57.270
What if Shark acknowledges you instead?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.590
And how would he acknowledge you?

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.550
Right! How do I do that?

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.700
You just have to win in a Duel.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.720
That's it!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.360
A Duel!

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.910
If I defeat Shark in a Duel...

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.950
<i>You're the only person I can trust Rio with.</i>

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.550
Shark...

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.450
Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.660
You're lovely!

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.760
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.480
Yes! I'm gonna Duel Shark right away!

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:40.840
W-Wait, Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.300
J-Just wait a minute!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.920
It must be love.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:51.770
A Duel, you say?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.270
You and me?

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.370
Th-That's right.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.450
If I win the Duel...

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.100
Well... Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:03.290
Put bluntly, you're not strong enough.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.350
Wh-What?!

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.450
If you're not at least at Yuma's level, give up now.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.200
Yuma's level?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.140
So she's fine with Yuma?!

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.230
She's fine with Yuma-<i>kun</i>?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.630
What's she "fine" about?

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.040
So that means...

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.930
I'm gonna bring this wedding to 'em!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.980
No way... Then Yuma is...

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:42.360
So Yuma's the only one you accept as Rio-<i>san</i>'s lover?!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.500
Are you serious?!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.470
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:54.440
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:57.150
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.500
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.580
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:17.090
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.460
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.680
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:27.220
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.350
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:32.060
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.520
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.570
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.030
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:46.070
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.830
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.290
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:55.000
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:04.050
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.210
Eh?! <i>Those two</i>?!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.750
But those two don't fit together.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.000
They're going out!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.840
Hey, did you hear?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:23.800
Eh? What?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.050
Those two are dating!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:25.880
For real?!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:33.100
Shark acknowledged Rio-<i>san</i> as Yuma-<i>kun</i>'s lover!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:34.230
"Shark VS Rio: The 100th Dueling Squabble!!"

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.480
With Yuma-<i>kun</i>, huh?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.230
This is huge news around the entire Heartland Academy!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.730
The "Big Couple" has finally appeared!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.400
H-Heh, r-really now?

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.950
Grrr! I meow-n't forgive her!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.410
What's the deal, Tetsuo?
 Calling me out here like this...

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.370
I-I honestly can't stand it!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.160
What?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.330
But she didn't want me.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.830
I wasn't good enough.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.710
So I'm going to pull out like a good sport!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:01.790
Huh?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.840
Yuma, I consider you my best friend.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.050
U-Uh, yeah, thank you!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.350
And that's why I'll entrust her to you!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.850
But I won't forgive you if you make Rio-<i>san</i> cry!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.520
What're ya talking about?!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:22.060
Yuma, your the one Shark has acknowledged as being good enough for Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:24.650
Eh!?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:25.610
Yes...

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.490
That's right, indeed.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.490
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.280
So Ryouga's the one who started this joke, right?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.420
Why are you calling me out like this all of a sudden?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.080
To challenge you to a Duel.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.460
Again...? You really can't help challenging me, huh?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.720
My patience has finally reached its maximum limit.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.390
What's that?

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.270
Who says you get to decide this just because you're my brother?!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.560
Rio-<i>san</i>... U-Um...

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.020
Would you mind keeping quiet for a while?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.060
Y-Yes...

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.860
What nonsense!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.860
Running away?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.780
And you have the name "Shark"? I'm astonished!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.570
And yet you despise onions so!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.860
And you always pick out the peppers!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:16.580
Be quiet! You've got <i>some nerve</i> insulting your big brother!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:20.410
Humph! Guess this makes our 100th sibling squabble Duel!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.710
Let's turn the tables.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.130
100th sibling squabble Duel?!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.380
A Duel between Shark and that sister of his...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.130
They've peeked my interest.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.680
Duel Disk, set!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.690
D-Gazer, set!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.110
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:48.530
Duel!!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.870
The first turn's mine! My turn! Draw!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.240
I Summon Big Jaws!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.130
Then I Special Summon Shark Sucker from my hand!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.890
Then I Overlay my Level Three Big Jaws and Shark Sucker!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.980
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:23.980
Xyz Summon!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.440
Submersible Carrier Aero Shark!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:35.990
That's Shark for you! He was able to Xyz Summon and decide this in the first turn!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.450
I activate Aero Shark's effect!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.620
I detach one Overlay Unit

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.710
in order to deal 400 damage to
 my opponent for each card in my hand!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.090
Shark's got four cards in his hand!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.920
1600 damage right off the bat?!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.880
I'll break that snotty nose of yours!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.590
Air Torpedo!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.010
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.680
I Special Summon Guard Penguin from my hand!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:07.400
When I take damage from an opponent's Card Effect,

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.690
I can negate that damage and Special Summon this card!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.450
She dodged Shark's head-start punch!

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:18.700
As expected, or not!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.450
Rio-<i>san</i>'s the best!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.080
I'd <i>expect</i> you to be capable of <i>this much</i>!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.670
I'm not exactly <i>wanting</i> to be praised by <i>you</i>!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.300
I activate the Field Magic from my hand, Aqua Gate!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:36.630
This card can negate a number of the opponent's attacks equal to

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.100
equal to the number of cards set in my Magic/Trap Zone!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.770
I then set two cards, ending my turn.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.480
Now I can stop two of your attacks.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.520
What'll you do?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.190
Hmph! I'll just show you my Dueling!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.360
My turn! Draw!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.530
I Summon Blizzard Falcon!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:08.370
I Overlay the Level Four Guard Penguin and Blizzard Falcon!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.000
Xyz Summon!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.420
Sylphine, the Sub-Zero Siren!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.720
Rio-<i>san</i>, your attack will be negated because of Aqua Gate's effect!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.850
Did you think I couldn't deal with something of this level?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.100
I activate Sylphine's effect!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.820
By detaching one Overlay Unit, until the start of my next turn,

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:38.450
Sylphine can negate the effects of all face-up Card Effects!

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.070
Perfect Freeze!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.420
She froze the Field!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.420
Now he can't defend himself with Aqua Gate.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.250
Not shabby!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.800
Next, for each card negated by this effect,

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:03.220
one of my opponent's Monster's Attack Power goes down 300 points for each!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:06.810
I negated the effects of both 
Aero Shark and Aqua Gate, totaling two!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:11.350
Thus, the Attack Power of Aero Shark goes down 600 points!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.270
Nice one, Rio-<i>san</i>! Go on and do it!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.990
<i>I can't accept that Ryouga forgot the effect of Sylphine.</i>

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.780
<i>Could Aqua Gate be a fake out?</i>

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.290
<i>The real deal is those set cards!</i>

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.160
<i>In that case...</i>

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:31.670
I equip Sylphine with the Equip Magic, Wings of Silence!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.250
This card raises the Attack Power
 of the equipped Monster by 300 points,

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:40.260
and is unaffected by the effects
 of my opponent's Magic and Trap Cards!

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:45.260
Now you can't aim for Sylphine with those set cards of yours.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.140
Nice of her to notice, but...

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.020
Sylphine, the Sub-Zero Siren, attack Aero Shark!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.400
Ice Ray!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.280
Heck yeah! Rio-<i>san</i>'s perfect!

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.910
So sorry I didn't fall into your little Trap.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.950
I <i>am</i> sorry...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.080
That your Dueling is so predictable, that is!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.880
Trap, activate! Ghost Fleet Salvage!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:24.720
When a Water-Attribute Xyz Monster is destroyed in battle,

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:28.760
this card negates its effect and
 Special Summons that Xyz Monster

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:32.310
along with the Xyz Material used
 to Summon it with their effects negated.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:37.520
I Special Summon Big Jaws, Shark Sucker, and Aero Shark!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.730
He got three Monsters at once!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.950
But their Monster Effects were negated...

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.580
Then I activate the Trap Card, Full-Armored Xyz!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:53.540
This card allows me to Xyz Summon during my opponent's turn!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:54.750
Say what?!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.960
I Overlay the Level Three Big Jaws and Shark Sucker!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.670
Xyz Summon!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:06.430
Tear up the pitch black darkness!
 Come forth, Black Ray Lancer!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:10.390
And, due to Full-Armored Xyz's effect,

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:17.100
I can equip Black Ray Lancer with Aero Shark, increasing its Attack Power by its Attack Points!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.040
It's got 4000 Attack Points!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.540
Now then, do you have a countermeasure?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.590
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.090
My turn! Draw!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.470
I activate the Magic Card, Break Stream, from my hand!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:51.350
Thanks to this effect, when Black Ray Lancer attacks,

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.060
the opposing player can't activate Magic and Trap Cards!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.650
It negates the effect of Sylphine negating the Field Magic.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:03.110
Now she's lost her means to protect against his attacks.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.990
<i>Rio-</i>san<i>, stay calm...</i>

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.200
Go, Black Ray Lancer! Attack Sylphine!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.290
Black Bright Spear!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.170
I'm not done! Break Stream has another effect!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.840
When Black Ray Lancer destroys a Monster,

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.510
it can destroy one of the opponent's Magic or Trap Cards!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.230
You don't stand a chance against me in the end.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.520
From the first time we started Dueling...

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.820
if I hadn't told you what cards to use,

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.110
you couldn't do anything.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.320
Don't... screw around with me...

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.120
Huh?

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:54.370
I'm not...

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.830
I'm not someone who can't do a thing without you by my side!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.790
I'm <i>me</i>!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:07.420
I activate the Trap Card, Oval Ice Fire!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:11.010
Eh?! Wasn't that card destroyed just now?!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:14.560
This card's effect activates when it's destroyed!

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.180
It Special Summons a Water-Attribute 
Xyz Monster from my Graveyard

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.850
with its Attack and Defense Power zero!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.860
Come before us once again, Sylphine!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:29.190
Then, the Monster resurrected by this card's effect

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.530
has its level raised one higher than its rank!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.160
Awesome!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.410
But her Attack Power is zero...

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:39.710
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.170
My turn.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.420
<i>If I don't draw that card this turn...</i>

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.010
<i>and if Ryouga reads my next move...</i>

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.970
The card I have set on my field now is my <i>real </i>set card.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.310
It <i>may</i> activate if you attack me...

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.100
You must be thinking this now...

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.600
But I wonder <i>what</i> the case is.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.480
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.110
Hmph! You won't get anything accomplished if you hesitate because of <i>that</i>!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.110
You haven't changed at all!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.240
You don't believe in your own strength!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.950
Now go and draw!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.920
You can't draw the card you want!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.380
That's not true!

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.380
Rio-<i>san</i>, believe in yourself!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.930
If you believe in yourself, your card will definitely come!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.390
You won't get anything if you hesitate like this!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.850
Advance forward!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.390
Tetsuo!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:42.980
That's right!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.190
Bring it to 'im!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.230
Bring it to 'im, Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.610
That's right. You're right.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.410
If I believe in myself, the path I desire will open up!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.820
My turn! Draw!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.250
Got it!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:05.540
I activate the Field Magic, Ice Fire World!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.300
With this card, when a Water-Attribute
 Monster is used as Xyz Material,

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.840
it can be treated as two!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:18.800
And I can raise Sylphine's level due to Oval Ice Fire!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.890
Now she's got two Level Five Monsters!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.810
I will advance forward!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.270
I Overlay my Level Five Sylphine!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.780
I use the Monster treated as two to build the Overlay Network!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.150
Xyz Summon!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.450
It's now time to break through your shell!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.290
Rioto Harpyia, the Sub-Zero Bird Princess!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.130
I then activate Rioto Harpyia's effect!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:59.260
I detach one Overlay Unit to reduce the opposing Monster's Attack Power to zero!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.140
Arm Freezing!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.690
She sealed the effect of that super powerful Monster!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:08.560
Awesome!

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:12.940
Go, Rioto Harpyia! Attack Black Ray Lancer!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.860
I activate Full-Armored Xyz's effect!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.870
I send the equipped Monster to the Graveyard in order to negate its destruction!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.040
But you'll still take the damage!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.370
Shark took a huge amount of damage!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.830
<i>So this is Rio-</i>san<i>'s evolution...</i>

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.340
I end my turn with that!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.970
So you came at me without being scared of my set card...

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:40.840
You sure have grown.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.010
Ryouga...

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.390
Is that what you thought I'd say?!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.730
You've still got a ways to go!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.060
My turn! Draw!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.980
I Summon Drill Drill Barnacle!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:19:00.410
Then I equip the Equip Magic,
 Xyz Jeweled Crown, to Black Ray Lancer!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:04.580
This effect transforms an Xyz Monster's rank into its level.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.370
Then it can be treated as two Xyz Materials!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.500
Then, because of Ice Fire World's effect,

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.500
I can treat Drill Barnacle as two Xyz Materials!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.380
That's just like with Sylphine before...!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:20.220
I Overlay the Level Three Drill Barnacle with Black Ray Lancer!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:25.310
I use these four Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.060
Xyz Summon!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.520
Come forth, Emperor of the Sea!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.730
Fanged Shark Emperor - Shark Kaiser!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.610
He use his opponent's Field Magic to his advantage.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.690
That's as expected of Shark.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.870
Shark Kaiser, attack!

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.240
Why?! Its Attack Power is lower than his opponent's!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.500
I activate Shark Kaiser's effect!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:53.790
I detach one Overlay Unit to increase its Attack Power by

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:59.880
by the original number of Overlay Units required to Summon it times 1000!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.590
Three Overlay Units were originally required to Summon it.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:07.220
Thus, its Attack Power goes up 3000 points!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.770
No way!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.350
Your own Field Magic destroyed you, Rio!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.190
Pulverize her, Shark Kaiser!

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.320
Kaiser Burst!!

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:38.920
Rio-<i>san</i>...

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:44.720
I lost!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.600
It's frustrating, but I still have a ways to go.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.480
Yeah. But I'll acknowledge your progress just now.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.480
But suddenly declaring Yuma as my lover...!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.940
Yuma, your <i>lover</i>...?

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.150
Who the hell would say <i>that</i>?

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.450
I have no idea.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.990
I only said that if Tetsuo wants to Duel me,

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.870
he has to be at Yuma's level.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.620
Then... Huh?

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.580
We misunderstood, or not?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.710
What the <i>heck</i>?

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:19.750
Uh...

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.510
That was an amazing Duel.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.760
Please Duel against me one of these days!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.220
With me?

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:28.550
Yes! I...want to get stronger...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.390
And if I win...

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.270
If you win...?

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.900
No, I'll tell you when it happens.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.610
I'll look forward to it, then.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:41.020
Yes!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.070
Now then, for the ones who spread this misunderstanding around the school...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.530
You two over there...?

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.370
Would you mind... spending some <i>time</i> with me?

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:00.380
So what was this whole Dueling squabble thing about anyway?

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.340
You don't need to know!

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.090
OW! That hurt!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:08.050
Gah, I got no clue!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:24.440
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:32.120
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:39.710
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:47.050
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.590 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:19.120
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:27.670
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:38.770
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:43.270
A school festival's about to start at my school!

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:46.610
And some Pro Duelists are supposed to fight here!

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.190
In a Couples Duel Tournament!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.200
Wonder who I should tag with...

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.570
Anna?! Why are you...?

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:54.120
Welcome to the Monster Cafe!

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.370
Why are you getting in my way?!

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:58.580
As expected of a pro's combination.

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:01.120
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:04.880
"A Fierce Couple Duel:
 "That Anna Chick" and I are a Tag Team!?"

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:08.760
We're fighting against two giant submarine Monsters!
